second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is Robin Wright known for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 89, \"text\": \"Robin Wright Robin Gayle Wright (born April 8, 1966) is an American actress and director.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00\", \"start\": 90, \"end\": 238, \"text\": \"She is the recipient of seven Primetime Emmy Award nominations and has earned a Golden Globe Award and a Satellite Award for her work in television.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00\", \"start\": 239, \"end\": 364, \"text\": \"Wright first gained attention for her role in the NBC Daytime soap opera \\\"Santa Barbara\\\", as Kelly Capwell from 1984 to 1988.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00\", \"start\": 365, \"end\": 486, \"text\": \"She then made the transition to film, starring in the romantic comedy fantasy adventure film \\\"The Princess Bride\\\" (1987).\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00\", \"start\": 487, \"end\": 585, \"text\": \"This role led Wright to further success in the film industry, with starring roles in films such as\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 34, \"text\": \"of international affairs\\\" in 2004.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 35, \"end\": 64, \"text\": \"She was also awarded the U.N.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 65, \"end\": 214, \"text\": \"Correspondents Association Gold Medal for analysis and coverage of international affairs, and the National Press Club award for diplomatic reporting.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 215, \"end\": 447, \"text\": \"She received the National Magazine Award for her reportage from Iran in \\\"The New Yorker\\\" and the Overseas Press Club Award for \\\"best reporting in any medium requiring exceptional courage and initiative\\\" for coverage of African wars.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 448, \"end\": 481, \"text\": \"She is the recipient of a John D.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 482, \"end\": 498, \"text\": \"and Catherine T.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 499, \"end\": 526, \"text\": \"MacArthur Foundation grant.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d01\", \"start\": 527, \"end\": 639, \"text\": \"She was awarded an Alicia Patterson Journalism Fellowship in 1975 to research projects of interest and she wrote\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 640, \"text\": \"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo Erika Berger 2013 The Congress Robin Wright Also producer Adoration Roz 2014 A Most Wanted Man Martha Sullivan 2015 Everest Peach Weathers 2017 Wonder Woman General Antiope Blade Runner 2049 Lieutenant Joshi Justice League General Antiope Uncredited cameo 2018 André the Giant Herself Documentary 2020 Wonder Woman 1984 General Antiope 2021 Land Edee Holzer Also director and executive producer Zack Snyder 's Justice League General Antiope 2023 Devil 's Peak Virgie Also producer 2024 Damsel Queen Isabelle Here Margaret Television [ edit ] Year Title Role Notes 1983–1984 The Yellow Rose Barbara Anderson 2\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 49, \"text\": \"continue this work of actually not being afraid .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 50, \"end\": 141, \"text\": \"I just feel like it took me a long time to grow up and to stop being inhibited in my work .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 142, \"end\": 194, \"text\": \"I would read scripts and go , 'Oh , I 'm not right .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 195, \"end\": 218, \"text\": \"I could never do this .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 219, \"end\": 257, \"text\": \"I could never achieve this character .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 258, \"end\": 298, \"text\": \"This would be better for somebody else .\"}, \"D4S7\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 299, \"end\": 304, \"text\": \"' ...\"}, \"D4S8\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d03\", \"start\": 305, \"end\": 448, \"text\": \"I do n't have that fear of jumping off the cliff , where before , I always used to just stop and ask for directions , and you would kind of see\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Robin Wright\", \"scope\": \"career\", \"claim\": \"Robin Wright is known for acting in films and television.\", \"answer\": \"acting in films and television\", \"quote\": \"Robin Wright Robin Gayle Wright (born April 8, 1966) is an American actress and director. She is the recipient of seven Primetime Emmy Award nominations and has earned a Golden Globe Award and a Satellite Award for her work in television. Wright first gained attention for her role in the NBC Daytime soap opera \\\"Santa Barbara\\\", as Kelly Capwell from 1984 to 1988. She then made the transition to film, starring in the romantic comedy fantasy adventure film \\\"The Princess Bride\\\" (1987).\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0174-a031829d36c0:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Robin Wright\", \"scope\": \"Film\", \"claim\": \"Robin Wright is known for portraying General Antiope in Wonder Woman and Justice League.\", \"answer\": \"Robin Wright is known for portraying General Antiope in Wonder Woman and Justice League.\", \"quote\": \"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo Erika Berger 2013 The Congress Robin Wright Also producer Adoration Roz 2014 A Most Wanted Man Martha Sullivan 2015 Everest Peach Weathers 2017 Wonder Woman General Antiope Blade Runner 2049 Lieutenant Joshi Justice League General Antiope Uncredited cameo 2018 André the Giant Herself Documentary 2020 Wonder Woman 1984 General Antiope 2021 Land Edee Holzer Also director and executive producer Zack Snyder 's Justice League General Antiope 2023 Devil 's Peak Virgie Also producer 2024 Damsel Queen Isabelle Here Margaret Television [ edit ] Year Title Role Notes 1983–1984 The Yellow Rose Barbara Anderson 2\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"acting in films and television\", \"portraying General Antiope in Wonder Woman and Justice League\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"acting in films and television\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"portraying General Antiope in Wonder Woman and Justice League\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"receiving awards such as the Golden Globe and Satellite Awards for her television work\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"playing the role of Kelly Capwell on the soap opera \\\"Santa Barbara\\\" from 1984 to 1988\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C